### 5. Error Handling for Tests
You might also want to enhance your error handling in the test cases to give more context when a failure occurs.

### Summary
The primary issue appears to be related to server initialization. The tests fail due to connection issues, suggesting that the server wasn't completely ready or there were errors when starting `main.py`. You should start with delaying the test execution after launching the server and look for any logs or exceptions that indicate issues in your application code.
